{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12114230","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12114230","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:2:1211423001:0":{"text":"我什么都不会说！你们趁早放弃！","source_cn":"我什么都不会说！你们趁早放弃！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x370464CFBDE60B18","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1211423002:0":{"text":"我猜也是。\n看你这傻大个的模样，船员聚在一起讨论战术的时候，肯定不带你。","source_cn":"我猜也是。\\n看你这傻大个的模样，船员聚在一起讨论战术...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAFDBD550CBC7ED19","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1211423003:1":{"text":"胡说！我知道！但我忠诚，我不说！","source_cn":"胡说！我知道！但我忠诚，我不说！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9C4E2F2D7EF9901B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1211423004:1":{"text":"说不出来就承认嘛，我又不会笑你。","source_cn":"说不出来就承认嘛，我又不会笑你。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC5B4CA172CB4DD99","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1211423005:1":{"text":"一艘船上总有那么几个不被重视的边缘人物，没事，不丢人。","source_cn":"一艘船上总有那么几个不被重视的边缘人物，没事，不丢人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x162FFD330C6A91F3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1211423006:1":{"text":"不……不！我知道！我参与了作战会议！","source_cn":"不……不！我知道！我参与了作战会议！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xADFA98E4ADDF5641","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1211423007:1":{"text":"哎哟，谁信呐。你不就是个搬炸药的苦力么？","source_cn":"哎哟，谁信呐。你不就是个搬炸药的苦力么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD60E387E743194D6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1211423008:1":{"text":"我不是！船长派我在这里保护炼金术师！我的工作很重要！","source_cn":"我不是！船长派我在这里保护炼金术师！我的工作很重要！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA444FC37BD3D3F42","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1211423009:1":{"text":"这话我也能编，我还说我是霍德希金安插在锈锚港的间谍呢。","source_cn":"这话我也能编，我还说我是霍德希金安插在锈锚港的间谍呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x567FAFD637F6D2AB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1211423010:1":{"text":"我没有骗你！船长很重视那名炼金术师！因为有些门只有他才能打开！","source_cn":"我没有骗你！船长很重视那名炼金术师！因为有些门只有他才...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB262AC3F4FFA8091","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1211423011:1":{"text":"嗯哼，不错的情报。谢啦，章鱼头老哥。","source_cn":"嗯哼，不错的情报。谢啦，章鱼头老哥。","status":"matched","ha